-- title:
--   Attachment of the opposite supersingular annulus, level 1· p
-- statement:
--   Fix a prime $p\ge 5$ and a valuation subring $A$ of $\overline{\mathbb Q}$ whose residue field $k$ is algebraically closed of characteristic $p$, and let $F=\overline{\mathbb Q}\cdot\,$`modularFunctionFieldFull (1*p)` be the base change to $\overline{\mathbb Q}$, inside Laurent series over $\overline{\mathbb Q}$, of the full modular function field of level $1\cdot p$. Let $Fbari$ be a field extension of $k$ and let $Ci$ be a component chart of $F$ along $A$ with values in $Fbari$: a valuation subring `Ci.integers` of $F$ lying over $A$, a surjective residue homomorphism onto $Fbari$ with kernel the maximal ideal, a set `Ci.dom` of places of $F/\overline{\mathbb Q}$, a finite set `Ci.nodes` of places of $Fbari/k$, and a map `Ci.placeMap` satisfying the chart axioms (compatibility with the residue map of $A$, scaling to nonzero residue, avoidance of nodes on the domain, pointwise specialisation of integral elements, and compatibility of divisors with `Ci.placeMap` off the nodes). Assume given $Xi\in Fbari$ and a family $xpli$ of places of $Fbari/k$ indexed by $k$ such that for every $c\in k$ and every polynomial $P$ over $k$ the order of $P(Xi)$ at $xpli\,c$ is the multiplicity of $c$ as a root of $P$; that the $q$-expansions $j$ and $j(q^{p})$ (the images under `coeffEmb` of `jq` and of `qExpand ℚ (1*p) jq`) lie in `Ci.integers` with residues $Xi$ and $Xi^{p}$; and that $xpli\,b$ is a node for every $b$ in `ssJSet p k`, the set of $j\in k$ such that every elliptic curve over $k$ with $j$-invariant $j$ has no nonzero $p$-torsion point. Let $a\in$ `ssJSet p k` satisfy $a^{p^{2}}=a$, $a\ne 0$ and $a\ne 1728$. Let $An'$ be an annulus of $F$ along $A$ (a set of places, a parameter, and a modulus in the maximal ideal of $A$, subject to the annulus axioms: rationality and integrality of the parameter on the domain, unique place with prescribed parameter value, simple vanishing of the parameter difference, and the unit principle) whose parameter satisfies $An'.\mathrm{param}\cdot\bigl(j(q^{p})-j^{p}\bigr)=p$ in $F$, and whose domain consists exactly of those places $W$ of $F/\overline{\mathbb Q}$ for which there are $x,y\in A$ with residues $a$ and $a^{p}$ such that $W$-ord$(j-x)>0$ and $W$-ord$(j(q^{p})-y)>0$. Assume further that every $g\in F$ whose Laurent series lies in `CharPReduction.modularLocalized (1*p) A.toSubring (IsLocalRing.residue A)` and has nonzero image under `CharPReduction.modularRedLocHom` belongs to `Ci.integers` with nonzero residue, and that for every $g\in$ `Ci.integers` whose Laurent series lies in that localised ring and whose reduction lies in `modularFunctionFieldC k 1` (the subfield of Laurent series over $k$ generated by `jqModC k` and `jqNModC k 1`), the order of `Ci.residue g` at $xpli\,a$ equals the order of that reduction at `charLGeomPlaceOfPoint k a`. The conclusion is that $An'$ is attached to $Ci$ at $xpli\,a$: the place $xpli\,a$ is a node of $Ci$; the parameter of $An'$ lies in `Ci.integers` and its residue has order exactly $1$ at $xpli\,a$; and for every $f\in$ `Ci.integers` with nonzero residue which has order $0$ at every place of $An'.\mathrm{dom}$, and every such place $P$, the value $P(f)\cdot P(An'.\mathrm{param})^{-\operatorname{ord}_{xpli\,a}(\overline f)}$ lies in $A$ and is a unit there. This is the instance at level $1\cdot p$ of [`ModularCurve.isAttached_oppAnnulus_inftyChart_of_chartSpec`](thm.html#ModularCurve.isAttached_oppAnnulus_inftyChart_of_chartSpec), which it cites.
--
--   In the function-field presentation of the semistable covering of $X_0(p)$ this glues the supersingular annulus with parameter $p/G$, $G=j(q^{p})-j^{p}$, to the component of the special fibre through the cusp $\infty$ at the node $X=a$, in the form required for the multiplicative covering data. It is used in the construction of multiplicative covering contexts and in the existence of component charts and attached annuli for prolongation tuples.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_isAttached_oppAnnulus_inftyChart_of_chartSpec_levelOne.lean

